From aece6faed929fda40d4316bcc089075cf82cd608 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: max <max@local>
Date: Mon, 31 Aug 2026 14:34:28 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 3/7] build: fix macOS-specific link and header issues for
 ceph-fuse

- std::max needs an explicit type: uint64_t and size_t are distinct types on
  Darwin (unsigned long long vs unsigned long), unlike LP64 Linux
- do not pass -lcap when libcap was not found; it is Linux-only
- keep macFUSE's FUSE 3 headers ahead of the FUSE 2 compatibility header
